WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.201 line:92%
-You grew up in Manhattan.

00:00:01.201 --> 00:00:02.235 align:start size:94% position:6%
Live in L.A.
Is it weird to come back?

00:00:02.235 --> 00:00:03.737 align:start size:94% position:6%
Has Manhattan changed a lot
since you were a kid?

00:00:03.737 --> 00:00:06.439
-It changed a lot,
'cause I grew up in the projects

00:00:06.439 --> 00:00:07.907 line:92%
on 16th Street and Ninth Avenue.

00:00:07.907 --> 00:00:09.776 align:start size:94% position:6%
And back in the day
it was the hood.

00:00:09.776 --> 00:00:12.278 align:start size:94% position:6%
And now it's called
the Meatpacking District.

00:00:12.278 --> 00:00:13.380 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:15.582 align:start size:94% position:6%
My street cred
is completely gone.

00:00:15.582 --> 00:00:17.317 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-It used to be like,

00:00:17.317 --> 00:00:18.251 size:84% position:42% line:92%
"Yo, I'm from Chelsea!"

00:00:18.251 --> 00:00:20.653
And they're like,
"Tsk, the Meatpacking District?"

00:00:20.653 --> 00:00:21.554 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:21.554 --> 00:00:23.523
And it's funny 'cause, you know,
my mom and my dad

00:00:23.523 --> 00:00:26.159
used to always say, "Y'all
better buy some property."

00:00:26.159 --> 00:00:28.361 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, you know,
we don't listen to parents.

00:00:28.361 --> 00:00:29.329 align:start size:94% position:6%
They're parents.
-Yeah.

00:00:29.329 --> 00:00:30.897 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So, you know, they're like --
my mom was like,

00:00:30.897 --> 00:00:31.831 line:92%
"You should buy this property,"

00:00:31.831 --> 00:00:34.501 align:start size:94% position:6%
and everything was so
dilapidated and messed up.

00:00:34.501 --> 00:00:35.402 line:92%
You know, she would be like,

00:00:35.402 --> 00:00:38.471 align:start size:94% position:6%
"You see that crack house
over there?

00:00:38.471 --> 00:00:41.074 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's gonna be New York's
hottest hotel."

00:00:41.074 --> 00:00:43.610 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
And it is.

00:00:43.610 --> 00:00:44.978 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, it is.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:44.978 --> 00:00:47.213 size:84% position:42%
-Called the Soho House.
-Yeah. There you go.

00:00:47.213 --> 00:00:49.049
-"You know that railway station
up there

00:00:49.049 --> 00:00:52.519 size:88% position:44%
with all the dead bodies
and the weeds that grow?

00:00:52.519 --> 00:00:55.255
That's gonna be something called
the High Line."

00:00:55.255 --> 00:00:56.423 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:56.423 --> 00:01:00.260 align:start size:94% position:6%
"You know that bodega?
Yeah, with all the stale food?

00:01:00.260 --> 00:01:02.362 align:start size:94% position:6%
Whole Foods!"
[ Laughter ]

00:01:02.362 --> 00:01:04.364 align:start size:94% position:6%
I should have listened.
-You should have listened.

00:01:04.364 --> 00:01:05.432 line:92%
-I'd be a billionaire right now.

00:01:05.432 --> 00:01:07.901 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So, this show is based on
your real life.

00:01:07.901 --> 00:01:09.402 line:92%
It's about raising two kids.

00:01:09.402 --> 00:01:10.637 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
-With your ex-wife.

00:01:10.637 --> 00:01:12.806 align:start size:94% position:6%
So this based on not only you,
but them.

00:01:12.806 --> 00:01:15.241 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
-How do they feel about being

00:01:15.241 --> 00:01:16.643 line:92%
portrayed on a television show?

00:01:16.643 --> 00:01:18.912
-Oh well they -- I mean, you
know, they're scared to death.

00:01:18.912 --> 00:01:22.015 align:start size:94% position:6%
'Cause they signed their life
rights to me, basically.

00:01:22.015 --> 00:01:23.883 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, yeah.
-And they're teenagers.

00:01:23.883 --> 00:01:25.351 align:start size:94% position:6%
I just tell them,
"Don't do nothing stupid,

00:01:25.351 --> 00:01:27.187 align:start size:94% position:6%
and it won't get in."
[ Laughter ]

00:01:27.187 --> 00:01:29.622
"'Cause I will put your business
in the street."

00:01:29.622 --> 00:01:31.357
You're gonna see like --
'cause they're teenagers.

00:01:31.357 --> 00:01:33.560 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's gonna be like,
"On a very special 'Marlon,'

00:01:33.560 --> 00:01:37.163 align:start size:94% position:6%
Shawn smokes weed."
[ Laughter ]

00:01:37.163 --> 00:01:39.632 line:92%
"Amai gets pregnant -- again."

00:01:39.632 --> 00:01:42.368 size:81% position:41%
It's -- it's gonna --
it's gonna be all bad.

00:01:42.368 --> 00:01:44.504
-How do they feel about
the actors who are playing them?

00:01:44.504 --> 00:01:47.674
-You know, my daughter likes
the girl because she's like,

00:01:47.674 --> 00:01:50.310
"She's smart like me."
And my daughter is really smart.

00:01:50.310 --> 00:01:53.113 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, she's gotten all A's
her whole life.

00:01:53.113 --> 00:01:54.814 line:92%
She got one B and she cried.

00:01:54.814 --> 00:01:57.717
I got one B in my life,
and I cried tears of joy.

00:01:57.717 --> 00:01:59.786 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was like, "I got a B!"
[ Laughter ]

00:01:59.786 --> 00:02:01.187 size:81% position:41% line:92%
And my son, he's like,

00:02:01.187 --> 00:02:03.690 align:start size:94% position:6%
my boy is like,
"I don't like the boy, Dad.

00:02:03.690 --> 00:02:05.058 line:92%
He don't remind me of me."

00:02:05.058 --> 00:02:06.693 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm like,
"Shawn, you're too cool.

00:02:06.693 --> 00:02:09.996 size:88% position:44%
You'd get me canceled.
You can't just be this."

00:02:09.996 --> 00:02:10.730 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:10.730 --> 00:02:13.066 align:start size:94% position:6%
"That's not gonna work on NBC.
The kid is funny."

00:02:13.066 --> 00:02:14.901 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. So you had to get --
you got to get somebody

00:02:14.901 --> 00:02:16.169
who was a little more energetic
than he is.

00:02:16.169 --> 00:02:18.771
-Yeah. Relaxed.
My son got too much cool on me.

00:02:18.771 --> 00:02:22.976 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then, his mom -- their mom
is always wanting to, like,

00:02:22.976 --> 00:02:24.310 line:92%
give notes on her character.

00:02:24.310 --> 00:02:26.679 align:start size:94% position:6%
She's like, "I don't know
if I would do that."

00:02:26.679 --> 00:02:28.081 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was like,
"Look, this ain't your show."

00:02:28.081 --> 00:02:30.817 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
"This show is called 'Marlon.'

00:02:30.817 --> 00:02:34.587
When we do 'Angela,' you can
give that character notes."

00:02:34.587 --> 00:02:35.221 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:35.221 --> 00:02:37.724 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Now, you embarrass
your kids on the show.

00:02:37.724 --> 00:02:39.159 size:75% position:38%
Is that something --
Are you a father who

00:02:39.159 --> 00:02:41.027 align:start size:94% position:6%
embarrasses your kids
in real life?

00:02:41.027 --> 00:02:42.262 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Yeah.

00:02:42.262 --> 00:02:43.363 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
From the beginning?

00:02:43.363 --> 00:02:45.865
-I just do it to be --
Yeah, from the beginning.

00:02:45.865 --> 00:02:47.834 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's when you're supposed to
start that.

00:02:47.834 --> 00:02:49.369 line:92%
I love my kids, but, you know,

00:02:49.369 --> 00:02:52.005 align:start size:94% position:6%
I just think that
it's fun to embarrass them.

00:02:52.005 --> 00:02:55.675 align:start size:94% position:6%
Okay. Like when they graduate,
like, from school,

00:02:55.675 --> 00:02:57.076 line:92%
it's a big accomplishment.

00:02:57.076 --> 00:02:58.044 size:84% position:42% line:92%
And I get really happy.

00:02:58.044 --> 00:02:59.746 align:start size:94% position:6%
And so my daughter
goes to get her --

00:02:59.746 --> 00:03:01.314 align:start size:94% position:6%
she graduated from like
fifth grade

00:03:01.314 --> 00:03:03.816 align:start size:94% position:6%
and all the parents, you know,
they get quiet and --

00:03:03.816 --> 00:03:06.019 align:start size:94% position:6%
I got up on the chair
and I said,

00:03:06.019 --> 00:03:09.189 align:start size:94% position:6%
"I know you ain't dumb!
I knew it!

00:03:09.189 --> 00:03:10.823 size:81% position:41% line:92%
I knew were you smart!

00:03:10.823 --> 00:03:12.025 size:81% position:41% line:92%
You gonna be somebody!

00:03:12.025 --> 00:03:15.195 align:start size:94% position:6%
You gonna be somebody!"
[ Laughter ]

00:03:15.195 --> 00:03:20.400 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:24.237 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then
when they were younger --

00:03:24.237 --> 00:03:26.439 size:84% position:42% line:92%
This is just messed up.

00:03:26.439 --> 00:03:27.507 line:92%
When they were younger --

00:03:27.507 --> 00:03:30.877
you know we had these readings
at their school where parents

00:03:30.877 --> 00:03:31.911 align:start size:94% position:6%
come and they read.
-Yeah, of course.

00:03:31.911 --> 00:03:33.813
-So I was like, "All right.
Cool. I'll come in and" --

00:03:33.813 --> 00:03:35.682 line:92%
And I read, I'm animated, right?

00:03:35.682 --> 00:03:36.416 size:84% position:42% line:92%
So I decided, you know,

00:03:36.416 --> 00:03:39.118 align:start size:94% position:6%
one year I'm gonna read
"We're Going On a Bear Hunt."

00:03:39.118 --> 00:03:41.487 align:start size:94% position:6%
And so I turn all the lights
down in the room,

00:03:41.487 --> 00:03:44.457 align:start size:94% position:6%
and they're in like
pre-kindergarten at the time.

00:03:44.457 --> 00:03:46.726 align:start size:94% position:6%
So I'm like, "We're going on
a bear hunt."

00:03:46.726 --> 00:03:49.762 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, you know,
"You went through the woods.

00:03:49.762 --> 00:03:52.131 size:81% position:41% line:92%
We go through the mud.

00:03:52.131 --> 00:03:53.766 line:92%
And then we get in the cave.

00:03:53.766 --> 00:03:54.567 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
We see some eyes."

00:03:54.567 --> 00:03:58.104 align:start size:94% position:6%
And we see some eyes
and I had Angela, their mom,

00:03:58.104 --> 00:04:00.373 size:81% position:41% line:92%
put on this bear mask.

00:04:00.373 --> 00:04:02.709 line:92%
And I said, "And we see a bear!"

00:04:02.709 --> 00:04:03.543 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
And she went "Wah!"

00:04:03.543 --> 00:04:07.380
You have never seen children
run this fast in your life.

00:04:07.380 --> 00:04:11.050 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
My son went [Screams]

00:04:11.050 --> 00:04:13.353 line:92%
Two little kids peed themselves.

00:04:13.353 --> 00:04:16.956 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was like, "Okay, well,
we shouldn't do that anymore.

00:04:16.956 --> 00:04:19.425 line:92%
No more realistic readings."

00:04:19.425 --> 00:04:20.994 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, congratulations
on the show.

00:04:20.994 --> 00:04:23.463
Congratulations -- you got
a movie on Netflix, "Naked,"

00:04:23.463 --> 00:04:24.897 align:start size:94% position:6%
that's available now to watch,
right?

00:04:24.897 --> 00:04:27.767 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
"Naked" right now on Netflix.

00:04:27.767 --> 00:04:29.602 size:75% position:38%
You ain't got to get
the bootleg, people.

00:04:29.602 --> 00:04:32.005 align:start size:94% position:6%
Although people will bootleg
anything.

00:04:32.005 --> 00:04:33.940 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, they got this thing
called the Fire Stick.

00:04:33.940 --> 00:04:35.608 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm on to all y'all.
-All right.

00:04:35.608 --> 00:04:40.780
-And NBC, my show comes out
Wednesday night on channel --

00:04:40.780 --> 00:04:43.316 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah. NBC.
-NBC, that's right here.

00:04:43.316 --> 00:04:44.717 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Wherever you are.

00:04:44.717 --> 00:04:48.354 align:start size:94% position:6%
Give it up for Marlon Wayans,
everybody!

00:04:48.354 --> 00:04:50.023 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
9:00 on NBC.

